@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Work Graph
+
+Work-item snapshots, dependency selection, launch grants and local dispatch records. Models belong to laomedo.work_graph; these cases preserve hashes, unknown outcomes and unchanged CLI output. fixtures contains historical input/output contracts, not live run evidence.
+
+Run from the repository root with `python -m unittest discover -s tests/test_work_graph -t tests -v`.
+
+Graph run persistence belongs to test_runs/ and the pinned graph runtime boundary to test_langflow/. Neither invokes a model.
